{"entrypoint": "slides/cover.html", "message": "Template Crewship Slides (mirror)", "files": [{"path": "deck.json", "media_type": "application/json", "content": "{\"schema_version\": 1, \"order\": [\"cover\", \"features\", \"chart\", \"flow\"]}"}, {"path": "slides/cover.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"cover\" data-transition=\"fade\">\n<div id=\"cover-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#0F1F33;border-color:#0F1F33;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-panel\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1200px;top:0px;width:720px;height:1080px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px;background-image:linear-gradient(160deg, #16304F 0%, #0F1F33 70%)\"></div>\n<p id=\"cover-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1072px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#E8833A;text-align:left;font-family:'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:4px;line-height:1.32\">TEMPLATE · SLIDES</p>\n<p id=\"cover-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:394px;width:1072px;height:180px;font-size:144px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1.05\">Crewship</p>\n<p id=\"cover-sub\" style=\"left:128px;top:577px;width:1100px;height:130px;font-size:44px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Posádka AI agentů, která převezme úkol a doručí výsledek.</p>\n<p id=\"cover-date\" style=\"left:128px;top:920px;width:1072px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#8A9BB0;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Testovací deck · listopad 2026</p>\n<div id=\"cover-icon\" data-icon=\"users\" style=\"left:1440px;top:400px;width:280px;height:280px;color:#E8833A\"></div>\n<aside id=\"cover-notes\">Titulní slide. Ukazuje vlastní typografii (IBM Plex Sans + JetBrains Mono), gradient na pozadí, ikonu s animací pop a přechod fade.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/features.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"features\" data-transition=\"push\">\n<div id=\"features-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#F4F1EA;border-color:#F4F1EA;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#B85E1F;text-align:left;font-family:'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:4px;line-height:1.32\">CO UMÍ SLIDES</p>\n<p id=\"features-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:223px;width:1664px;height:96px;font-size:72px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1.1\">Tři věci, které deck zvládne sám</p>\n<div id=\"features-card1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:128px;top:366px;width:533px;height:554px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<div id=\"features-card1-icon\" data-icon=\"message-circle\" style=\"left:177px;top:415px;width:72px;height:72px;color:#E8833A\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card1-title\" style=\"left:177px;top:511px;width:435px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Komentáře</p>\n<p id=\"features-card1-body\" style=\"left:177px;top:592px;width:435px;height:100px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.4\">Kolega napíše poznámku přímo k prvku slidu.</p>\n<div id=\"features-card2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:693px;top:366px;width:533px;height:554px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<div id=\"features-card2-icon\" data-icon=\"play\" style=\"left:742px;top:415px;width:72px;height:72px;color:#E8833A\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card2-title\" style=\"left:742px;top:511px;width:435px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Prezentace</p>\n<p id=\"features-card2-body\" style=\"left:742px;top:592px;width:435px;height:100px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.4\">Režim Present s přechody a animacemi prvků.</p>\n<div id=\"features-card3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1259px;top:366px;width:533px;height:554px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<div id=\"features-card3-icon\" data-icon=\"send\" style=\"left:1308px;top:415px;width:72px;height:72px;color:#E8833A\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card3-title\" style=\"left:1308px;top:511px;width:435px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Export</p>\n<p id=\"features-card3-body\" style=\"left:1308px;top:592px;width:435px;height:100px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.4\">Stažení jako .pptx nebo PDF jedním klikem.</p>\n<p id=\"features-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#6A7179;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Template Crewship Slides · 2</p>\n<aside id=\"features-notes\">Karty s ikonami. Každý prvek jde v editoru přesunout, přepsat a okomentovat.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/chart.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"chart\" data-transition=\"fade\">\n<div id=\"chart-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#F4F1EA;border-color:#F4F1EA;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"chart-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:96px;font-size:72px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1.1\">Dokončené úkoly rostou každý týden</p>\n<p id=\"chart-big\" style=\"left:128px;top:622px;width:560px;height:232px;font-size:200px;color:#E8833A;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1\">38</p>\n<p id=\"chart-big-caption\" style=\"left:128px;top:830px;width:560px;height:100px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.4\">úkolů v týdnu T6, trojnásobek oproti T1 (12)</p>\n<div id=\"chart-bar1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:816px;top:720px;width:96px;height:152px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:976px;top:645px;width:96px;height:227px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1136px;top:683px;width:96px;height:189px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar4\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1296px;top:569px;width:96px;height:303px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar5\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1456px;top:480px;width:96px;height:392px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar6\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1616px;top:392px;width:96px;height:480px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px;border-radius:6px\"></div>\n<p id=\"chart-label1\" style=\"left:784px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">T1 · 12</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label2\" style=\"left:944px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">T2 · 18</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label3\" style=\"left:1104px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">T3 · 15</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label4\" style=\"left:1264px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">T4 · 24</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label5\" style=\"left:1424px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">T5 · 31</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label6\" style=\"left:1584px;top:888px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">T6 · 38</p>\n<p id=\"chart-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#6A7179;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Testovací data · Template Crewship Slides · 3</p>\n<aside id=\"chart-notes\">Graf jako SVG přímo ve slidu, velké číslo jako hlavní sdělení. Data jsou testovací.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/flow.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"flow\" data-transition=\"fade\">\n<div id=\"flow-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#0F1F33;border-color:#0F1F33;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:96px;font-size:72px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:700;line-height:1.1\">Jak crew pracuje</p>\n<div id=\"flow-box1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:128px;top:450px;width:344px;height:186px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box1-title\" style=\"left:168px;top:490px;width:264px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Zadání</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box1-sub\" style=\"left:168px;top:559px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">CLI nebo web</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link1\" data-shape=\"line\" data-line=\"0 12 96 12\" data-arrow-end=\"triangle\" style=\"left:472px;top:531px;width:96px;height:24px;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:4px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:568px;top:450px;width:344px;height:186px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box2-title\" style=\"left:608px;top:490px;width:264px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Kapitán</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box2-sub\" style=\"left:608px;top:559px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">rozdělí práci</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link2\" data-shape=\"line\" data-line=\"0 12 96 12\" data-arrow-end=\"triangle\" style=\"left:912px;top:531px;width:96px;height:24px;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:4px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1008px;top:450px;width:344px;height:186px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box3-title\" style=\"left:1048px;top:490px;width:264px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Agenti</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box3-sub\" style=\"left:1048px;top:559px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">každý svou roli</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link3\" data-shape=\"line\" data-line=\"0 12 96 12\" data-arrow-end=\"triangle\" style=\"left:1352px;top:531px;width:96px;height:24px;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:4px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box4\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1448px;top:450px;width:344px;height:186px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px;border-radius:24px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box4-title\" style=\"left:1488px;top:490px;width:264px;height:64px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';font-weight:600;line-height:1.3\">Výsledek</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box4-sub\" style=\"left:1488px;top:559px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">k review</p>\n<p id=\"flow-caption\" style=\"left:128px;top:878px;width:1664px;height:46px;font-size:32px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Diagram ze tvarů a spojnic – v editoru jde každý box posunout.</p>\n<p id=\"flow-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#8A9BB0;text-align:left;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans';line-height:1.3\">Template Crewship Slides · 4</p>\n<aside id=\"flow-notes\">Diagram z nativních prvků: boxy, x-connector šipky. Export do PPTX zachová editovatelné tvary.</aside>\n</section>\n"}]}
